  description: 'Freeride through the mountains and straight through three luxury chalets: dodge the robot vacuums in the Lodge, time the sliding doors and fly out of the gallery''s panoramic window; carve the snow park''s kickers and rails and swipe four tricks over the gorge; bounce through the bumper bowl, hop the floating platforms over the river, slide across the Spa''s marble between the hot tubs and swipe three tricks over the indoor pool; on the stormy ridge steer in the air onto one fork of the split landing, swipe five tricks, then bowl a STRIKE in the Party Chalet, spin across the disco floor and steer the last split jump home!'
